      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-2",
      "number": 2,
      "heading": "Bake the chips",
      "blocks": [
        "Toss the chips with oil, salt and pepper on a large tray and spread in a single layer. Use two trays if needed. Bake on the middle shelf for 30–35 minutes until golden, turning halfway."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
