        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "alt": "Sketch of chips spread on baking tray",
        "credit": "Illustration based on the HelloFresh recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-3",
      "number": 3,
      "heading": "Bake the chicken",
      "blocks": [
        "Put the breasts in an ovenproof dish. Drizzle with oil and season with mixed herbs, salt and pepper. Roast on the top shelf for 25–30 minutes until cooked through with no pink in the middle. Wash hands and equipment after handling raw chicken."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
