    {
      "id": "step-4",
      "number": 4,
      "heading": "Finish the prep",
      "blocks": [
        "Mix the marinara sauce with {{marinara-honey}} honey in a small bowl. Grate the cheddar and halve the baby plum tomatoes."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
